    <item rdf:about="http://urmp.org/bugs/start?rev=1246467937&amp;do=diff">
        <dc:format>text/html</dc:format>
        <dc:date>2009-07-01T13:05:37-05:00</dc:date>
        <title>bugs:start</title>
        <link>http://urmp.org/bugs/start?rev=1246467937&amp;do=diff</link>
        <description>*  Error when using -b on an empty directory
	*  Ability to link directories into loop
	*  -b should take a filename as well as a directory
	*  dbsplit --help doesn't work
	*  CFLAGS=-g ./configure doesn't work
	*  -b will hang if a process dies unexpectedly
	*  urmp doesn't handle kill -STOP &lt;mplayer&gt; well
	*  Adding an album doesn't work if the songs are by differnt artists</description>
    </item>
